body: "Evidence: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/actions/runs/35336550583/job/105572855482. The first cli-transport-floor test generates twelve isolated one-item fixtures for explicit iterations=1 and sixty-six for the default ten iterations, all under one per-test deadline. Measurements are injected but filesystem generation/removal is real. Investigate fixture efficiency or separation of distinct assertions without reducing benchmark sample depth, increasing budgets or suppressing failures. No runtime latency assertion failed in this incident."
